  "content_html": "<div class=\"product-description j-product-description\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<h2>Rich Vibes Shimmer Body Scrub by Be Trendy — a glow you can't hide!</h2>\n<p>Experience the feeling of luxury and confidence with Rich Vibes Body Scrub by Be Trendy. This is more than just skincare — it’s a true beauty ritual that leaves your skin perfectly smooth, nourished, and beautifully radiant.</p>\n<p>Gentle exfoliating particles delicately polish the skin, removing dead skin cells and revealing its natural beauty. Leaves your skin feeling velvety, soft, and incredibly pleasant to the touch.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/body-scrub-02.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<h2>The secret to exceptional care lies in the blend of precious oils.</h2>\n<p><strong>Hemp seed oil </strong>helps maintain optimal moisture balance, improves skin elasticity, and provides lasting comfort.<strong> Coconut oil</strong> intensely nourishes and softens the skin, leaving it feeling incredibly delicate and well-cared-for.</p>\n<p>The true magic of Rich Vibes comes from its exquisite shimmer, which wraps the skin in a delicate glow. <strong>Light-reflecting </strong>particles beautifully enhance your tan, give the skin a healthy, well-groomed appearance, and create a radiant glow effect that captures attention at first glance.</p>\n<h2><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/body-scrub-01.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></h2>\n<h2>Why You'll love the Rich Vibes Shimmer Body Scrub</h2>\n<p>Rich Vibes by Be Trendy is designed for those who love to shine, feel confident, and turn everyday skincare into a moment of pure pleasure.</p>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Gently exfoliates and renews the skin</li>\n<li>Provides a luxurious shimmering glow</li>\n<li>Nourishes and softens with hemp seed and coconut oils</li>\n<li>Leaves skin smooth and silky</li>\n<li>Enhances the skin’s natural beauty and healthy appearance</li>\n</ul>\n<h2> </h2>\n<h2>How to Use for Maximum Results</h2>\n<p>1. Apply a small amount of scrub to damp skin while showering or bathing.</p>\n<p>2. Massage gently over the body using circular motions, paying special attention to areas prone to dryness and roughness, such as elbows, knees, and feet.</p>\n<p>3. Continue massaging for 1–2 minutes to allow the exfoliating particles to remove dead skin cells while the nourishing hemp seed and coconut oils begin caring for the skin.</p>\n<p>4. Rinse thoroughly with warm water.</p>\n<p>5. If desired, follow with a body lotion, cream, or oil to enhance the moisturizing effect.</p>\n<p><strong>Recommended Use</strong></p>\n<p>Use 1–2 times per week.</p>\n<p>Ideal for preparing the skin before applying self-tanner or before special occasions when you want your skin to look smooth, radiant, and beautifully illuminated.</p>\n<p><strong>Results</strong></p>\n<p>After use, the skin feels soft, smooth, and silky, while the delicate shimmer leaves it with an elegant glow and a naturally radiant appearance.</p>\n<h2><img alt=\"\" height=\"600\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://betrendy.space/content/uploads/images/body-scrub-03.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></h2>\n<h2>Who Is «Rich Vibes» Shimmer Body Scrub For?</h2>\n<ul data-spread=\"false\">\n<li>Suitable for all skin types, particularly when your skin is craving extra softness, smoothness, and deep nourishment.</li>\n<li>Perfect for dry and flaky skin, as hemp seed and coconut oils help maintain comfort and a healthy-looking appearance.</li>\n<li>Ideal for anyone who wants to achieve a natural glow without using additional cosmetic products.</li>\n<li>Great for at-home SPA enthusiasts who value both visible results and the pleasure of self-care rituals.</li>\n<li>A perfect choice before special events, photoshoots, celebrations, or vacations when you want your skin to look exceptionally smooth, radiant, and well cared for.</li>\n<li>Excellent for enhancing a tan, as the shimmering particles beautifully reflect light and visually improve the skin’s appearance.</li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n\n<p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/btI3KIHxNIA\">https://www.youtube.com/embed/btI3KIHxNIA</a></p></p>\n</div>\n</div>",
